# ==============================================================================
# DocHub Git 忽略规则（严格保护密钥、大体积本地模型与临时构建产物）
# ==============================================================================

# --- 环境变量与密钥（严禁提交任何真实密钥或私钥） ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.p12
secrets/

# --- 本地模型权重与缓存（如本地 BGE / HuggingFace 模型文件） ---
models/
*.safetensors
*.onnx
*.gguf
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.bin
huggingface/
.cache/

# --- Python 运行与虚拟环境产物 ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.venv/
venv/
env/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
pip-wheel-metadata/

# --- Node.js / 前端构建与缓存产物 ---
node_modules/
frontend/dist/
frontend/.vite/
frontend/coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# --- IDE / 操作系统临时文件 ---
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
*.swp
*.swo
*.log

# --- 本地临时运行状态、日志与数据备份 ---
tmp/
backups/
*.tar.gz
*.sql.gz
*.dump

# --- 本地参考文档与测试目录（仓库仅保留 README.md） ---
PRD.md
TECHNICAL_SPEC.md
docs/
frontend/COSS_UI_LICENSE.md
backend/tests/
frontend/src/__tests__/
frontend/src/test/
